      "mergedPostDetails": "When we're in Europe invite + any worlds, when we decided rejoin the same instance, we stuck with connecting long maybe 2 or 3 mins wait, it refreshed itself, joined America Friend instance we never asked for.\n\nnote: it's happened when all player selected rejoin at same time.\n\nHere the video:",
