      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} that had been a while I think started that happened around many months ago. I thought VRChat team will fix it.. but it's kept going on until today, I thought maybe no one report this bug. \n\nI found out it's only happened when more than two friends click rejoin at same times, this will happened.\n\nHow and where can I show the log?",
